# Pinned taskbar shortcut name | icon file name without .ico
# Names are matched without Windows' " (n)" suffix and may use * (Rider's name includes its version).
# Plain names come from yet-another-monochrome-icon-set (apps/scalable/<name>.svg, built by build-icons.sh).
# logo-* icons are monochrome versions of the app's own icon (see README); the set has no match for these.
# File Explorer, Claude, Terminal and Wintoys aren't pinned shortcuts; they get their icons from the
# taskbar styler (see README).
